# t112's shape PLUS one temporal read — the traced twin.
#
# THE POINT OF THIS FIXTURE is an empty intersection. The suite had temporal
# fixtures and boxed-assign fixtures, and no fixture where BOTH held, so the
# traced arm of the observed boxed store was unreachable by any gate. Round 35
# caught a slot_from_value consume-use-after-free in aot_observe_val — and the
# same author rebuilt the same bug in the same round, in the sibling function
# aot_trace_assign_val, under a comment claiming "Borrows val". slot_from_value
# TAKES OWNERSHIP: the trace call freed the numeric box one line before the
# observe increfed it.
#
#   VM   130 / diverging / 1 / done      AOT  10 / moving / 0 / done
#   both build, both rc 0 — wrong prev, wrong report, wrong predicate
#
# Valgrind stays silent (freelist-recycled box, the known arena blind spot), so
# this fixture is the only durable guard. The `prev of a` below is what sets
# g_traced and is load-bearing: without it this file is t112 again.

import _t113m

a is 100.0
a is _t113m.step of a
a is _t113m.step of a
a is _t113m.step of a
a is _t113m.step of a
print of (prev of a)
print of (report of a)
print of (diverging of a)
print of "done"
